<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Compliance &amp; Legal | EPR Access Limited</title>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="public-body">
  <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
  <main>
    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Compliance &amp; Legal</h1>
        <p>We operate with full regulatory compliance and transparency.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Our Regulatory Status</h2>
          <p>EPR Access Limited is fully registered and compliant with Nigerian laws</p>
        </div>
        <div class="compliance-grid">
          <div class="compliance-item">
            <img src="/images/compliance/cac.jpeg" alt="CAC Certificate" class="compliance-img" />
            <h3>CAC — Corporate Affairs Commission</h3>
            <p>Registered with the Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC) of Nigeria. RC No: 8851262.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compliance-item">
            <img src="/images/compliance/WhatsApp Image 2026-05-22 at 1.29.34 AM.jpeg" alt="SEC Certificate" class="compliance-img" />
            <h3>SEC — Securities &amp; Exchange Commission</h3>
            <p class="compliance-status"><span class="text-danger">SEC</span> on Review</p>
            <p>Licensed and regulated by the Securities and Exchange Commission of Nigeria as a capital market operator.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compliance-item">
            <img src="/images/compliance/WhatsApp Image 2026-05-22 at 1.28.50 AM.jpeg" alt="EFCC Certificate" class="compliance-img" />
            <h3>EFCC — Economic &amp; Financial Crimes Commission</h3>
            <p>Fully compliant with the Economic and Financial Crimes Commission regulations for transparent financial operations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compliance-item">
            <img src="/images/compliance/WhatsApp Image 2026-05-22 at 1.31.13 AM.jpeg" alt="Federal Ministry of Industry, Trade &amp; Investment" class="compliance-img logo-fit" />
            <h3>Ministry of Industry, Trade &amp; Investment</h3>
            <p>Certified and recognised by the Federal Ministry of Industry, Trade and Investment — Nigeria.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-dark">
      <div class="container two-col">
        <div class="col-text">
          <h2>Investor Protection</h2>
          <p>Your investment is protected by legally binding agreements. All investment plans come with clear terms, defined return rates, and structured payout schedules.</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Written investment agreements for all plans</li>
            <li>Transparent fee structure with no hidden charges</li>
            <li>Regular account statements and reporting</li>
            <li>Dedicated dispute resolution process</li>
            <li>Data protection in compliance with NDPR</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-text">
          <h2>Risk Disclosure</h2>
          <p>All investments carry inherent risk. EPR Access Limited employs rigorous risk management practices, but investors should note:</p>
          <ul class="checklist checklist-warning">
            <li>Past returns do not guarantee future performance</li>
            <li>Capital is at risk in market-linked products</li>
            <li>Fixed deposit returns are contractually guaranteed</li>
            <li>Investors should diversify their portfolios</li>
            <li>Read all terms before investing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
